167
00:05:32.779 --> 00:05:33.717
Part 7.

168
00:05:33.997 --> 00:05:35.043
Speak today.

169
00:05:36.293 --> 00:05:43.226
Say 5 sentences about your day using the Subject, then Verb, then Object, then Place, then Time order.

170
00:05:43.506 --> 00:05:47.559
Say 3 negative sentences about things you don't like (I don't like...).

171
00:05:47.839 --> 00:05:50.591
Make one long sentence with what, where, when, why.

172
00:05:51.941 --> 00:05:53.477
That's the end of this lesson.

173
00:05:53.757 --> 00:05:58.429
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

174
00:05:58.709 --> 00:06:04.811
